                            <Polygon POINTS="354 2057 354 2072 2126 2072 2126 2057 2126 2020 1911 2016 1909 2016 1814 2028 1781 2016 1779 2016 1777 2016 1638 2028 1582 2016 1580 2016 1578 2016 1551 2028 1278 2028 1147 2016 1145 2016 1143 2016 1141 2016 1122 2029 1038 2029 999 2016 997 2016 995 2016 993 2016 962 2026 882 2016 880 2016 728 2028 666 2016 664 2016 541 2028 508 2016 506 2016 504 2016 502 2016 500 2016 483 2029 354 2029 354 2057"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="ment is usually preceded by a challenge to a wrestling-match, and inflicted"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l28" HPOS="354" VPOS="2074" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="61" BASELINE="356 2119 2122 2115" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="356 2119 356 2131 2118 2135 2122 2115 2118 2086 2071 2074 2069 2074 2067 2074 2046 2084 1972 2074 1970 2074 1904 2084 1882 2074 1880 2074 1878 2074 1876 2074 1855 2084 1831 2074 1829 2074 1828 2074 1763 2084 1736 2074 1734 2074 1732 2074 1650 2084 1629 2074 1627 2074 1371 2074 1370 2074 1307 2084 1270 2074 1268 2074 1266 2074 1264 2074 1225 2086 1140 2076 1138 2076 1136 2076 1103 2086 851 2076 849 2076 847 2076 808 2086 769 2076 767 2076 765 2076 763 2076 761 2076 746 2086 623 2076 621 2076 565 2086 510 2076 508 2076 506 2076 469 2086 395 2076 393 2076 391 2076 354 2088 356 2119"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="after the victory in the dance. I mentioned before¹ the tale of the “Lucky"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l29" HPOS="356" VPOS="2133" WIDTH="1655" HEIGHT="58" BASELINE="358 2174 2011 2178" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2174 356 2185 2007 2191 2011 2178 2011 2146 1976 2135 1974 2135 1972 2135 1621 2144 1574 2135 1572 2135 1525 2144 1473 2135 1471 2135 1426 2144 1401 2135 1399 2135 1397 2135 1395 2135 1362 2144 1327 2135 1325 2135 1323 2135 1260 2144 1229 2135 1227 2135 1225 2135 1223 2135 1186 2144 1171 2133 1169 2133 1167 2133 1165 2133 1163 2133 1138 2143 1062 2133 1060 2133 1007 2143 976 2133 974 2133 972 2133 970 2133 947 2144 863 2144 849 2133 847 2133 845 2133 843 2133 841 2133 812 2143 722 2133 721 2133 358 2141 358 2174"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="Suitor,” in which such an incident is described with characteristic details."/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
                <TextBlock ID="mz_3-137_r4" HPOS="353" VPOS="2215" WIDTH="1782" HEIGHT="819" TAGREFS="TYPE_2">
<Shape>
                        <Polygon POINTS="353 2215 2135 2215 2135 3034 353 3034"/>
                    </Shape>
                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l30" HPOS="463" VPOS="2228" WIDTH="1655" HEIGHT="55" BASELINE="465 2256 2118 2263" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="465 2256 463 2267 500 2279 502 2279 504 2279 834 2271 880 2281 882 2283 2116 2283 2118 2263 2116 2236 465 2228 465 2256"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="“The hero married a proud girl, who had previously refused all her suitors. One of them,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l31" HPOS="356" VPOS="2279" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="358 2308 2122 2304" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2308 358 2322 2118 2324 2122 2304 2116 2279 356 2281 358 2308"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="who lived in a neighboring camp, met her outside, threw her to the ground, and scratched her"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l32" HPOS="356" VPOS="2328" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="46" BASELINE="356 2355 2124 2355" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="356 2355 356 2367 2122 2374 2124 2355 2124 2328 356 2328 356 2355"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="face with the point of his knife. The lucky suitor came to her camp shortly after the incident,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l33" HPOS="356" VPOS="2369" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="358 2402 2124 2398" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2402 358 2415 2120 2417 2124 2398 2118 2369 356 2373 358 2402"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="vanquished her in a running-match, and was accepted. The next fall the neighbor who had scratched"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l34" HPOS="358" VPOS="2417" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="358 2449 2126 2449" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2449 358 2460 2124 2464 2126 2449 2124 2417 358 2419 358 2449"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the woman’s face invited the people, saying, ‘Let us again have races and running-matches!’ All"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l35" HPOS="358" VPOS="2468" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="43" BASELINE="358 2495 2126 2495" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2495 358 2511 2126 2511 2126 2495 2126 2468 358 2468 358 2495"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the people assembled, and all took part in a running-match. The newly married one did not take"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l36" HPOS="358" VPOS="2515" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="41" BASELINE="358 2542 2126 2542" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="358 2542 358 2554 2124 2556 2126 2542 2126 2515 358 2515 358 2542"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="off his outer fur shirt. He ran in his usual clothes. Nevertheless he came back first. All the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l37" HPOS="360" VPOS="2552" WIDTH="1760" HEIGHT="52" BASELINE="360 2587 2120 2587" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="360 2587 360 2601 2116 2604 2120 2587 2116 2552 360 2558 360 2587"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="others were behind. Then he sprang forward, and said, ‘Well, come on [for a wrestling-match].’"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l38" HPOS="358" VPOS="2601" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="360 2632 2126 2636" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="360 2632 358 2645 2122 2649 2126 2636 2122 2601 360 2601 360 2632"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="His face was inflamed with anger. ‘Who wants to try? Hurry up!’ — ‘Who knows?’ answered"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l39" HPOS="358" VPOS="2649" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="45" BASELINE="360 2677 2126 2682" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="360 2677 358 2688 2122 2694 2126 2682 2124 2655 360 2649 360 2677"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="the others. ‘Let this one wrestle with me!’ and he pointed out the neighbor who in the past year"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l40" HPOS="360" VPOS="2696" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="360 2727 2128 2727" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="360 2727 360 2741 2126 2743 2128 2727 2128 2700 360 2696 360 2727"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="had scratched his wife’s face. ‘No,’ says the neighbor, looking down. ‘Hurry up!’ said the other."/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l41" HPOS="360" VPOS="2741" WIDTH="1768" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="362 2772 2128 2776" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="362 2772 360 2784 2124 2788 2128 2776 2126 2747 362 2741 362 2772"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="He continued to refuse. Then at last the lucky suitor sprang toward him and kicked him in the"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l42" HPOS="358" VPOS="2786" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="46" BASELINE="360 2817 2124 2821" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="360 2817 358 2829 2120 2832 2124 2821 2120 2786 360 2788 360 2817"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="face. The other one fell down and swooned. After a while he sat up on the ground. ‘Hurry up!’"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l43" HPOS="362" VPOS="2834" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="362 2866 2128 2866" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="362 2866 362 2881 2124 2883 2128 2866 2126 2836 362 2834 362 2866"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="He rose, but continued to refuse. Then the lucky suitor caught him, threw him down, and pressed"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l44" HPOS="360" VPOS="2883" WIDTH="1766" HEIGHT="49" BASELINE="362 2914 2126 2910" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="362 2914 362 2928 2122 2932 2126 2910 2122 2885 360 2883 362 2914"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="him with his knee to the ground. Then he took out his girdle-knife, and cut his nostrils all over,"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l45" HPOS="360" VPOS="2928" WIDTH="1770" HEIGHT="47" BASELINE="362 2957 2130 2961" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="362 2957 360 2973 2126 2975 2130 2961 2120 2930 362 2928 362 2957"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="also his eyelids and his cheeks. His whole face he cut into strips, in revenge for the treatment of"/>
                    </TextLine>

                    <TextLine ID="mz_3-137_l46" HPOS="364" VPOS="2973" WIDTH="181" HEIGHT="48" BASELINE="364 3006 545 3006" TAGREFS="TYPE_6">
                        <Shape>
                            <Polygon POINTS="364 3006 364 3021 545 3021 545 3006 543 2973 364 2973 364 3006"/>
                        </Shape>
                        <String CONTENT="his wife.”"/>
                    </TextLine>
</TextBlock>
